* Packable on Aztec
** Two encodings
*** Serialize / Deserialize = ABI,\nintrinsic layout, derive it
*** Packable = storage and notes,\nonly must round-trip
*** Same struct, different layouts
** What N costs
*** PublicMutable: N slots,\nN SLOAD / SSTORE
*** DelayedPublicMutable: 2N + 2 slots,\nneeds Eq
*** Notes: N hash inputs = gates
*** Calldata: Serialize, not Packable
** Writing it
*** Bit widths; total <= 253 bits
*** Multiply by 2^k and add,\nor mask bits
*** Unpack low to high:\ncast, subtract, divide
*** Round-trip test at\nall combinations and maxima
** Example: two flags + string
*** Derived N = 3 (one Field per bool)
*** Packed N = 2: flags as bits,\nFieldCompressedString stays one Field
*** ABI unchanged: getter still 3 fields
** Traps the EVM does not have
*** Circuit arithmetic is not free:\nmeasured +7 gates on a private read
*** Changing N moves every slot after:\nnotes become unspendable
*** Schedule with a storage break,\nappend new fields at the end
** When to pack
*** Several sub-Field members,\nhot path, notes
*** Not: all Field-sized, ABI only,\nrare and deployed
@endmindmap
